    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im pretty sure i'm fine though, im not really seeing a doctor for something like this. i did get some bloodwork done a few months ago and my kidneys were a little bit slow/high on the creatinine but they said it was fine and to just drink more water. since my kidneys are a bit weak, is there a limit i should stay under so i don't mess them up? or is 800mg safe enough?",
